{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Unhinged Pet Store Simulator&quot; is a pet store simulator where you sell pet products in a chaotic environment. Expected random events, weird interractions and rudy customers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manage the Store</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design, expand and run a pet store. Buy masses of wares, stock shelves and sell!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651130/extras/1592c54948a35108bd0791e6c520ba39.poster.avif?t=1769865658\" width=792 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651130/extras/1592c54948a35108bd0791e6c520ba39.webm?t=1769865658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651130/extras/1592c54948a35108bd0791e6c520ba39.mp4?t=1769865658\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Handle the Chaos</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to handle the chaos all while running your daily business!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651130/extras/be723c54b43120057c00369a73c83690.poster.avif?t=1769865658\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651130/extras/be723c54b43120057c00369a73c83690.webm?t=1769865658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651130/extras/be723c54b43120057c00369a73c83690.mp4?t=1769865658\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Random Events</stron